{"LID": 67, "STAGE": 3, "TITLE": "Phrasal Verbs (Essential 40)", "TITLE_AR": "الأفعال المركّبة الأساسية (40 فعلاً)", "TIMER": 80, "XP": 55, "FULL_HTML": "\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.9;color:#1e293b\">\n\n<h1 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:3px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:10px\">🎯 الدرس 22: الأفعال المركّبة الأساسية — 40 Phrasal Verbs</h1>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eff6ff;border-right:5px solid #3b82f6;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:18px 0\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#1d4ed8;margin-bottom:8px\">📌 الهدف من الدرس</h2>\n<p>في نهاية هذا الدرس ستكون قادراً على:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>إتقان <b>40 فعلاً مركّباً</b> من أكثر الأفعال شيوعاً في الإنجليزية.</li>\n<li>التمييز بين <b>Separable</b> و <b>Inseparable</b>.</li>\n<li>فهم <b>المعاني المتعدّدة</b> لنفس الفعل المركّب.</li>\n<li>استخدامها بشكل طبيعي في المحادثة والكتابة.</li>\n<li>فهم Listening والمحادثات بشكل أعمق.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🔑 ما هو الفعل المركّب؟</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7;border:2px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:14px 0\">\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:600\">Phrasal Verb = <b>فعل + حرف جر/ظرف</b>، يعطي معنى جديداً غالباً مختلفاً عن الكلمتين منفردتين.</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fde68a\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الفعل المركّب</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">المعنى الحرفي</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">المعنى الحقيقي</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">give up</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">يعطي + فوق</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">يستسلم / يقلع عن</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">look after</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">ينظر + بعد</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">يعتني بـ</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">put off</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">يضع + بعيداً</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">يؤجّل</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#059669;margin-top:24px\">📚 الأنواع الأربعة</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">1️⃣ Separable Transitive (يقبل الفصل، يأخذ مفعولاً)</h3>\n<p>يمكن وضع المفعول بين الفعل وحرف الجر:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>Turn <b>off</b> the light. = Turn the light <b>off</b>. ✅</li>\n<li>⚠️ مع الضمير: يجب الفصل: Turn <b>it</b> off. (لا تقل: Turn off it)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">2️⃣ Inseparable Transitive (لا يقبل الفصل، يأخذ مفعولاً)</h3>\n<p>يجب أن يبقى الفعل والحرف معاً:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>I look <b>after</b> my brother. ✅</li>\n<li>❌ I look my brother after. (خطأ)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">3️⃣ Intransitive (لا يأخذ مفعولاً)</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>The plane took <b>off</b> at 6 AM. (أقلعت — بدون مفعول)</li>\n<li>Please come <b>in</b>. (تفضّل بالدخول)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">4️⃣ Three-word Phrasal Verbs (ثلاثية — دائماً Inseparable)</h3>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>I look <b>forward to</b> seeing you.</li>\n<li>She came <b>up with</b> a great idea.</li>\n<li>Don't put <b>up with</b> rude behavior.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">📋 الـ 40 فعلاً الأساسية مصنّفة حسب الموضوع</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#16a34a\">🟢 المجموعة 1: الحياة اليومية (10 أفعال)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:14px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#16a34a;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #16a34a\">#</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #16a34a\">الفعل</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #16a34a\">المعنى</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #16a34a\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">1</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>wake up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يستيقظ</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">I wake up at 7 AM.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">2</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>get up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينهض من السرير</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">I get up at 7:15.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">3</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>put on</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يلبس</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">Put on your jacket.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">4</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>take off</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يخلع / تقلع طائرة</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">Take off your shoes.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">5</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>turn on / off</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يشغّل / يطفئ</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">Turn on the TV.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">6</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>look for</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يبحث عن</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">I'm looking for my keys.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">7</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>look after</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يعتني بـ</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">She looks after her grandma.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">8</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>get along (with)</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينسجم مع</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">I get along with my brother.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">9</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>run out of</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينفد منه شيء</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">We ran out of milk.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;text-align:center\">10</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\"><b>throw away</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يرمي</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr\">Throw away the trash.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#3b82f6\">🔵 المجموعة 2: العمل والدراسة (10 أفعال)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:14px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#3b82f6;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #3b82f6\">#</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #3b82f6\">الفعل</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #3b82f6\">المعنى</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #3b82f6\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">11</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>hand in</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يسلّم</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">Hand in your homework.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#eff6ff\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>hand out</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يوزّع</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">The teacher handed out papers.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>fill in / out</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يملأ (نموذجاً)</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">Fill in the form.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#eff6ff\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>look up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يبحث في قاموس</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">Look up the word.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">15</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>find out</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يكتشف / يعرف</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">I found out the truth.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#eff6ff\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">16</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>figure out</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يفهم / يحلّ</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">I can't figure out this problem.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">17</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>go over</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يراجع</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">Let's go over the notes.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#eff6ff\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">18</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>come up with</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يخرج بفكرة</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">She came up with a plan.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">19</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>put off</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">يؤجّل</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">Don't put off the work.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#eff6ff\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;text-align:center\">20</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\"><b>carry out</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd\">ينفّذ / يجري</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #93c5fd;direction:ltr\">Scientists carried out research.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#d97706\">🟡 المجموعة 3: العلاقات والمشاعر (10 أفعال)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:14px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#d97706;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #d97706\">#</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #d97706\">الفعل</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #d97706\">المعنى</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #d97706\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">21</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>fall in love</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يقع في الحب</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">They fell in love instantly.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fffbeb\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">22</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>break up (with)</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">ينفصل عن</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">She broke up with him.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">23</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>make up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يتصالح / يختلق</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">They made up after the fight.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fffbeb\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">24</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>get over</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يتجاوز (حزناً)</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">I can't get over the loss.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">25</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>cheer up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يبهج / يبتهج</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">Cheer up! It will be fine.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fffbeb\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">26</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>calm down</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يهدأ</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">Please calm down.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">27</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>look forward to</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يتطلّع إلى</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">I look forward to your reply.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fffbeb\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">28</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>put up with</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يتحمّل / يتجلّد</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">I can't put up with his rudeness.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">29</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>count on</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يعتمد على</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">You can count on me.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fffbeb\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;text-align:center\">30</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\"><b>show off</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24\">يتباهى</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fbbf24;direction:ltr\">Stop showing off!</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#dc2626\">🔴 المجموعة 4: الأهداف والصعوبات (10 أفعال)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:14px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#dc2626;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">#</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">الفعل</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">المعنى</th><th style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">31</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>give up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يستسلم / يقلع عن</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">Never give up!</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fef2f2\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">32</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>go through</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يمرّ بـ (تجربة)</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">She went through a tough time.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">33</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>get away with</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يفلت بفعلته</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">He got away with cheating.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fef2f2\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">34</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>back up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يدعم / ينسخ احتياطياً</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">Back up your files.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">35</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>break down</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يتعطّل / ينهار</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">My car broke down.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fef2f2\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">36</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>turn down</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يرفض / يخفض الصوت</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">He turned down the offer.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">37</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>take over</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يستلم / يسيطر</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">She took over the project.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fef2f2\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">38</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>set up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">ينشئ / يؤسّس</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">He set up a company.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">39</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>work out</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">يتمرّن / ينجح</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">It worked out perfectly.</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#fef2f2\"><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;text-align:center\">40</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\"><b>end up</b></td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5\">ينتهي به الأمر</td><td style=\"padding:6px;border:1px solid #fca5a5;direction:ltr\">I ended up staying home.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">⚠️ قاعدة الضمائر مع Separable</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fee2e2;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:5px solid #dc2626;margin:14px 0\">\n<p><b>مع noun:</b> الترتيب اختياري</p>\n<p>✅ Turn <b>off</b> the light. = Turn the light <b>off</b>.</p>\n<p><b>مع pronoun (it/them/her/him):</b> الفصل إلزامي</p>\n<p>✅ Turn <b>it</b> off. (لا تقل: <s>Turn off it</s>)</p>\n<p>✅ Pick <b>them</b> up. (لا تقل: <s>Pick up them</s>)</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🎯 Mini-Drill — املأ الفراغ</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e8ff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0\">\n<ol style=\"padding-right:24px\">\n<li>Can you ___ this word in the dictionary? → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>look up</b></span></li>\n<li>I'm ___ to seeing you next week. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>looking forward</b></span></li>\n<li>Don't ___ on solving big problems. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>give up</b></span></li>\n<li>She ___ a brilliant idea during the meeting. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>came up with</b></span></li>\n<li>I can't ___ his rude behavior anymore. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>put up with</b></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">⚠️ الأخطاء الشائعة</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fecaca\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">❌ خطأ</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">✅ صواب</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">السبب</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Turn off <s>it</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Turn <b>it</b> off.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">الضمير يأتي بين الفعل والحرف</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I look forward <s>to see</s> you.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I look forward <b>to seeing</b> you.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">to هنا حرف جر → V-ing</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I <s>look my brother after</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I look <b>after</b> my brother.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">look after = inseparable</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I <s>found the truth out</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">I found <b>out</b> the truth.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">find out مع noun طويل: لا تفصل</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">He <s>gave smoking up</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">He <b>gave up</b> smoking.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">مع gerund (V-ing): لا تفصل</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🧠 حِيَل الذاكرة</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#dcfce7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #16a34a;margin:10px 0\">\n<p>🎯 <b>اربط بالموقف:</b> \"wake up\" — مشهد الاستيقاظ صباحاً. تخيّل المشهد عند الحفظ.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>تعلّمها بالأزواج المتضادّة:</b> turn on/off, put on/take off, hand in/out.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>ركّز على الثلاثية:</b> look forward to / come up with / put up with — دائماً مع شكلها الكامل.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>التعلّم في سياق:</b> اقرأ جملاً وحاول تخمين المعنى قبل ترجمتها.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>الضمير في المنتصف:</b> turn it off / pick them up — قاعدة ذهبية.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">📊 Quick Recap</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1e40af;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">النوع</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">الخاصية</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Separable</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">يقبل الفصل (مع noun) / إلزامي مع pronoun</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">turn on / turn it on</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Inseparable</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">لا يقبل الفصل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">look after the kids</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Intransitive</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">بدون مفعول</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">The plane took off.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Three-word</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">دائماً inseparable</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">put up with / look forward to</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:2px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:6px\">📖 أمثلة تطبيقية (15)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#4f46e5;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">#</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">English</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">العربية</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">القاعدة</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I always wake up at 6 AM to exercise before work.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أستيقظ دائماً الساعة 6 صباحاً لأمارس الرياضة قبل العمل.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">wake up = يستيقظ (intransitive)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">2</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Please turn the lights off when you leave the room.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">رجاءً أطفئ الأنوار عند مغادرة الغرفة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">turn off = separable (مع noun: اختياري)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I'm looking forward to meeting you next month.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أتطلّع إلى لقائك الشهر المقبل.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">look forward to + V-ing (ثلاثي)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">4</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">She came up with a brilliant solution to the problem.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">خرجت بحلٍّ عبقري للمشكلة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">come up with = ابتكار فكرة</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">5</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Don't put off until tomorrow what you can do today.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لا تؤجّل إلى الغد ما يمكنك فعله اليوم.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">put off = يؤجّل</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">6</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">He gave up smoking after 20 years of the habit.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أقلع عن التدخين بعد 20 سنة من العادة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">give up + V-ing = يقلع عن</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">7</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">We ran out of gas in the middle of the highway.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">نفد منّا الوقود في منتصف الطريق السريع.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">run out of = ينفد</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">8</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I can't put up with his constant complaining anymore.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">لا أستطيع تحمّل تذمّره الدائم بعد الآن.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">put up with = يتحمّل</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">9</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">The teacher handed out the exam papers to all students.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">وزّع المعلّم أوراق الامتحان على جميع الطلاب.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">hand out = يوزّع</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">10</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Could you look after my dog while I'm on vacation?</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">هل يمكنك الاعتناء بكلبي وأنا في إجازة؟</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">look after = يعتني بـ (inseparable)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">11</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">My car broke down on the way to the office this morning.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">تعطّلت سيارتي في الطريق للمكتب هذا الصباح.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">break down = يتعطّل</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">She turned down a job offer because the salary was too low.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">رفضت عرض عمل لأنّ الراتب كان منخفضاً جداً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">turn down = يرفض</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">They set up a successful business in less than two years.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">أسّسوا شركة ناجحة في أقلّ من سنتين.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">set up = يؤسّس</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">I ended up working overtime because of the urgent deadline.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">انتهى بي الأمر للعمل ساعات إضافية بسبب الموعد النهائي العاجل.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">end up + V-ing = ينتهي بـ</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">15</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Can you pick me up from the airport at 7 PM tonight?</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">هل يمكنك أن تأخذني من المطار الساعة 7 مساءً الليلة؟</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">pick up = يقلّ (مع pronoun: الفصل إلزامي)</td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#059669;border-bottom:2px solid #059669;padding-bottom:6px\">📚 المفردات الأساسية (18)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#059669;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الكلمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">النطق IPA</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الترجمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">مثال</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">phrasal verb</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈfreɪzl vɜːrb/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">فعل مركّب</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">\"Give up\" is a phrasal verb.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">separable</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈseprəbl/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">قابل للفصل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Turn on is separable.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">inseparable</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪnˈseprəbl/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">غير قابل للفصل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Look after is inseparable.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">transitive</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈtrænsətɪv/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">متعدٍّ (يأخذ مفعولاً)</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">\"Pick up\" is transitive.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">intransitive</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪnˈtrænsətɪv/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">لازم</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">\"Wake up\" is intransitive.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">give up</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɡɪv ʌp/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يستسلم / يقلع عن</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Never give up on your dreams.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">put off</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/pʊt ɔːf/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يؤجّل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Don't put off your work.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">figure out</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈfɪɡjər aʊt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يفهم / يحلّ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I figured out the answer.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">come up with</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/kʌm ʌp wɪð/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يخرج بفكرة</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">She came up with a plan.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">look forward to</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/lʊk ˈfɔːrwərd tə/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتطلّع إلى</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I look forward to your call.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">put up with</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/pʊt ʌp wɪð/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتحمّل</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I can't put up with noise.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">break down</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/breɪk daʊn/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يتعطّل / ينهار</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">My phone broke down.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">set up</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/set ʌp/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يؤسّس / ينصب</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">They set up a tent.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">end up</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/end ʌp/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينتهي به الأمر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I ended up sleeping there.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">get along</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɡet əˈlɔːŋ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينسجم</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">We get along well.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">run out of</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/rʌn aʊt əv/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينفد منه</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">We ran out of time.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">count on</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/kaʊnt ɒn/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يعتمد على</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">You can count on me.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">carry out</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈkæri aʊt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينفّذ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">They carried out the plan.</td></tr></table></div>"}